Source-Makefile: package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile

Package: ipq-wifi-8dev_habanero-dvk
Submenu: ath10k Board-Specific Overrides
Version: 2
Depends: +libc @(TARGET_ipq40xx||TARGET_ipq806x)
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: firmware
Category: Firmware
Title: board-2.bin Overrides for 8devices Habanero DVK
Maintainer: 
Source: 
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
Type: ipkg
Detail-Description: board-2.bin Overrides for 8devices Habanero DVK
Description: The 8devices Habanero DVK requires board-specific, reference ("cal") data
that is not yet present in the upstream wireless firmware distribution.

This package supplies board-2.bin file(s) that, in the interim,
overwrite those supplied by the ath10k-firmware-* packages.

This is package is only necessary for the 8devices Habanero DVK.

Do not install it for any other device!

@@

