Package: jamvm
Submenu: Java
Version: 2.0.0-2
Depends: +libc +zlib +libpthread +librt +classpath @(i386||i686||x86_64||arm||armeb||mips||mipsel||powerpc||powerpc64) +CONFIG_powerpc64:libffi
