Package: https-dns-proxy
Version: 2021-07-29-5
Depends: +libc +libcares +libcurl +libev +ca-bundle
Conflicts: https_dns_proxy
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: net
Category: Network
Repository: base
