Source-Makefile: package/network/services/stunnel/Makefile

Package: stunnel
Version: 5.72-4
Depends: +libc +libopenssl +zlib +libpthread
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: net
Category: Network
Repository: base
Title: SSL TCP Wrapper
Maintainer: Florian Eckert <fe@dev.tdt.de>
CPE-ID: cpe:/a:stunnel:stunnel
Require-User: stunnel:stunnel
Source: stunnel-5.72.tar.gz
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
LicenseFiles: COPYING.md COPYRIGHT.md
Type: ipkg
Detail-Description: SSL TCP Wrapper
Description: 	Stunnel is a program that allows you to encrypt arbitrary TCP
	connections inside SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) available on both Unix
	and Windows. Stunnel can allow you to secure non-SSL aware daemons and
	protocols (like POP, IMAP, LDAP, etc) by having Stunnel provide the
	encryption, requiring no changes to the daemon's code.
http://www.stunnel.org/
Florian Eckert <fe@dev.tdt.de>
@@


